@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@token = demo-token

### 健康检查
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### 当前用户
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 非流式聊天
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "用一句话解释 Agent。"
    }
  ]
}

###

### 流式聊天
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/stream
Accept: text/event-stream
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "用大约 300 个字解释什么是 Agent。"
    }
  ]
}

###

### JD 结构化提取
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/extract
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "job_description": "负责 FastAPI 后端服务开发，要求熟悉 Python、Pydantic 和异步编程。"
}

###

### JobFit ReAct 岗位匹配
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/match
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "job_description": "岗位：Python 后端实习生。职责：使用 FastAPI 开发后端接口，参与 Agent 应用开发。要求：熟悉 Python；了解 Pydantic 和异步编程；有 LLM 应用开发经验者优先。",
  "resume_text": "姓名：张三。技能：Python、FastAPI、Pydantic、异步编程基础。项目：使用 FastAPI 完成课程项目，并调用大模型 API 实现多轮问答。"
}

###

### 创建持久化分析任务
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/tasks
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "job_id": 1,
  "resume_version_id": 1,
  "conversation_id": null
}

###

### 执行持久化分析任务
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/tasks/1/run
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 查询任务状态（Redis Cache-Aside）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/tasks/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 流式执行任务（SSE）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/tasks/1/stream
Accept: text/event-stream
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
